/* Service worker for a published talk deck.
 *
 * Cache-first over an explicit, build-time asset list. Not a runtime-populated
 * cache: a deck is a fixed set of files known at build time, and precaching all
 * of them is what makes the deck work in a room with no network — which is the
 * only reason this file exists.
 *
 * CACHE_NAME embeds a content hash of the asset list, so a republish creates a
 * new cache and the activate handler drops every older one. Without that, a
 * viewer who installed an earlier version would keep serving it forever.
 *
 * Generated by .github/scripts/talk-build-html.py — do not edit dist/sw.js.
 */

